WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:01.230
Hi there!

00:00:01.254 --> 00:00:04.910
Does your salon have staff who buy supplies, or travel for work?

00:00:05.412 --> 00:00:08.350
Let each of them hand in their own receipts on Tositeo.

00:00:08.619 --> 00:00:11.470
You just approve them, or send them back to be fixed.

00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:16.670
This lesson covers inviting employees, giving them roles, and approving expenses.

00:00:17.264 --> 00:00:19.314
In the Settings menu, choose Team.

00:00:19.732 --> 00:00:24.219
Under Invite a person, enter the employee's e-mail, choose a role,

00:00:24.169 --> 00:00:26.034
then click Send invitation.

00:00:26.487 --> 00:00:30.674
The employee gets an e-mail, sets their own password, and can start right away.

00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:32.602
There are five roles.

00:00:32.756 --> 00:00:36.202
An Employee only adds their own receipts and travel claims.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:38.762
An Approver can approve everyone's expenses.

00:00:39.095 --> 00:00:43.962
An Admin also handles settings, the bank, reimbursements and exports.

00:00:44.231 --> 00:00:45.722
The Owner has full rights.

00:00:46.074 --> 00:00:50.522
And a Reader only sees shared documents, like payslips, and is free of charge.

00:00:51.132 --> 00:00:54.051
When an employee sends a receipt or a travel claim,

00:00:54.001 --> 00:00:56.301
you get a notification on the bell icon.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.301
The Waiting for your approval box on the Overview page shows the count too.

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.861
Click it, or open Approvals in the menu.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:07.276
The Approvals page gathers every receipt and travel claim waiting,

00:01:07.226 --> 00:01:08.396
from the whole team.

00:01:08.825 --> 00:01:11.356
Click a name to see the photo and the details.

00:01:11.626 --> 00:01:14.823
Tick the items that are correct, add a note if you like,

00:01:14.773 --> 00:01:16.396
then click Approve selected.

00:01:16.816 --> 00:01:19.516
Even dozens of receipts take just one click.

00:01:20.148 --> 00:01:24.177
If a receipt isn't right, for example the description is missing, tick it,

00:01:24.127 --> 00:01:25.682
and write what needs fixing.

00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:28.642
When you return something, a note is required.

00:01:28.913 --> 00:01:30.562
Then click Return selected.

00:01:31.244 --> 00:01:35.618
On the employee's side, the Overview page shows a Returned to you box.

00:01:35.858 --> 00:01:38.658
When they open the receipt, your note is right at the top.

00:01:39.007 --> 00:01:42.338
The employee fixes it, then clicks Send for approval again.

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:46.498
Every approval, return and fix is recorded in History.

00:01:47.185 --> 00:01:50.893
If you want expenses to go straight to the accountant without approval,

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:52.439
untick Expenses need approval,

00:01:52.588 --> 00:01:53.799
in Company settings.

00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:55.479
Now take the quiz below.
